  {
   "section": "link-list-3",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "More information and resources"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "VA health care copay rates",
     "href": "/health-care/copay-rates/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "View our current copay rates for different types of care, tests, and medications."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "VA mental health services",
     "href": "/health-care/health-needs-conditions/mental-health/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Find out how to access VA mental health services for posttraumatic stress disorder (PTSD), psychological effects of military sexual trauma (MST), depression, grief, anxiety, and other needs."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Specific health needs and conditions",
     "href": "/health-care/health-needs-conditions/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Find out how to get care for specific needs (like women’s health), and learn about service-related health concerns you should be aware of (like Agent Orange-related diseases or Camp Lejeune water contamination)."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Chemical or hazardous material exposure",
     "href": "/health-care/health-needs-conditions/chemical-hazardous-materials-exposure/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Learn about health concerns linked to exposures during military service. Learn about the special VA health registries you can join that document Veterans’ exposure to Agent Orange, depleted uranium, ionizing radiation, airborne hazards, and other hazardous materials."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "Veterans programs for health and wellness",
     "href": "/health-care/wellness-programs/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "Explore VA programs to help you get and stay healthy in both body and mind."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Community care",
     "href": "https://www.va.gov/COMMUNITYCARE/programs/veterans/index.asp"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "If you’re enrolled in VA health care, find out how you may be able to receive care from a provider in your local community through community care."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "Income limits and your VA health care",
     "href": "https://www.va.gov/health-care/income-limits/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Learn how your income affects your VA health care eligibility and costs. And find out if you may be eligible for free or reduced cost health care based on your income."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "The Affordable Care Act (ACA) and your VA health care coverage",
     "href": "/resources/the-affordable-care-act-aca-and-your-va-health-care-coverage/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Find out what you need to know about the Affordable Care Act and what it means for Veterans."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "The Million Veteran Program",
     "href": "https://www.research.va.gov/mvp/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Check if you can be a part of this voluntary research study to better understand the role genes play in our health."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "Access and quality in VA health care",
     "href": "https://www.accesstocare.va.gov/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "Get information about your VA facility, like how quickly you can be seen and what other Veterans say about their experiences."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Patient rights and responsibilities",
     "href": "https://department.va.gov/vha/patient-rights/"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "Review your basic rights and responsibilities when you receive care at a VA health facility or live in a VA community living center."
    }
   ],
